1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,890
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:08,020
=Episode 27=

5
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:09,279
Mr. Ling,

6
00:00:09,439 --> 00:00:10,519
it's all over the internet.

7
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:12,160
They're saying S&D's Lin Hua

8
00:00:12,279 --> 00:00:13,240
stole Lingyu's design.

9
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:14,439
(Proof!)
Now they're blaming her.

10
00:00:14,439 --> 00:00:15,780
(S&D's Lin Hua accused of
stealing Lingyu's design)

11
00:00:16,839 --> 00:00:18,039
Who authorized this story?

12
00:00:18,559 --> 00:00:20,120
Our publicity team didn't release it.

13
00:00:20,519 --> 00:00:22,079
A few clickbait accounts broke it first.

14
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:26,879
Get the head of design in here.

15
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:27,519
Yes, sir.

16
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:33,759
Ling Hao,

17
00:00:34,439 --> 00:00:35,039
did you leak

18
00:00:35,079 --> 00:00:36,240
that story about Lin Hua on purpose?

19
00:00:36,719 --> 00:00:38,240
Haven't you got better things to do?

20
00:00:39,039 --> 00:00:40,880
I don't play dirty to win a woman.

21
00:00:42,159 --> 00:00:42,840
Then how did you get

22
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:43,840
Lin Hua's plans?

23
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:48,840
What do you mean?

24
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:51,439
I'm as clueless as you are.

25
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:56,560
Looks like

26
00:00:57,479 --> 00:00:59,119
someone's using you to destroy her.

27
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:02,439
Find out

28
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:04,359
who brought in those plans,

29
00:01:04,439 --> 00:01:05,239
who contacted the press...

30
00:01:05,359 --> 00:01:06,120
Find out.

31
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:06,719
Yes, sir.

32
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:08,799
Tell me what you find.

33
00:01:10,599 --> 00:01:12,000
Now you're acting like you care?

34
00:01:14,319 --> 00:01:16,519
I heard no one hurt her worse than you.

35
00:01:19,319 --> 00:01:20,120
That's why

36
00:01:21,079 --> 00:01:22,400
I can't let her be framed again.

37
00:01:34,079 --> 00:01:34,599
Sirong,

38
00:01:35,519 --> 00:01:36,920
Lin Hua's finished this time, right?

39
00:01:38,959 --> 00:01:40,799
She's always acting so high and mighty.

40
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:44,120
Let's see how long she lasts at S&D.

41
00:01:47,359 --> 00:01:49,599
She should've stayed away from Zheng

42
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:52,280
and stopped making it all about her.

43
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:54,560
Li Sirong,

44
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:55,879
were you behind

45
00:01:56,040 --> 00:01:56,719
that online leak?

46
00:01:58,840 --> 00:02:00,000
What are you talking about?

47
00:02:00,439 --> 00:02:01,400
Lingyu traced it.

48
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,400
The first people
to contact those accounts

49
00:02:03,599 --> 00:02:04,519
were the Lis' publicists.

50
00:02:06,959 --> 00:02:08,360
I don't know what you're talking about.

51
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,080
I'll ask you again.

52
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,039
Was it you?

53
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,360
You're interrogating me?

54
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:17,039
Gu Zheng,

55
00:02:17,599 --> 00:02:18,800
I'm your fiancee!

56
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:20,479
Why are you questioning me
over her again?

57
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:23,199
That's why I've tolerated you
time and again.

58
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:25,319
But you've gone too far this time.

59
00:02:26,039 --> 00:02:27,240
You had no right to ruin her career.

60
00:02:27,639 --> 00:02:28,800
Her career?

61
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,080
What career?

62
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:31,319
I just let everyone

63
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,800
see who she really is.

64
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:34,439
I'm the one who finally sees

65
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,039
the truth.

66
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:38,039
What do you mean?

67
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:38,840
You...

68
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,719
Gu Zheng, stop right there!

69
00:02:41,599 --> 00:02:42,319
Get back here!

70
00:02:42,879 --> 00:02:43,560
Come back!

71
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:50,159
As for the claims

72
00:02:50,199 --> 00:02:52,000
that I plagiarized or leaked files,

73
00:02:52,199 --> 00:02:52,759
I'll go through

74
00:02:52,879 --> 00:02:53,680
the timeline

75
00:02:53,759 --> 00:02:54,800
and explain it all.

76
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:56,800
This is the first draft

77
00:02:56,879 --> 00:02:58,280
I drew up a month ago.

78
00:02:59,159 --> 00:03:00,639
The core structure was already set.

79
00:03:00,879 --> 00:03:02,039
The public walkway,

80
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:03,120
the sunken garden,

81
00:03:03,319 --> 00:03:04,159
and the city gallery

82
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,439
were all part of my original design.

83
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:07,159
This is

84
00:03:07,719 --> 00:03:09,479
my cloud backup log.

85
00:03:10,039 --> 00:03:10,719
It shows

86
00:03:10,759 --> 00:03:12,479
every time I revised the plans,

87
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:13,319
and what I changed.

88
00:03:15,039 --> 00:03:16,400
Version histories can be faked.

89
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,000
You're right.

90
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:23,719
So I brought a third piece of evidence.

91
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:25,960
Look at this symbol.

92
00:03:28,599 --> 00:03:29,280
This symbol

93
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:30,759
is a modified version of my initials,

94
00:03:30,919 --> 00:03:32,680
LH, for Lin Hua.

95
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:34,919
It proves this is my original draft.

96
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:37,280
What Lingyu Group obtained was my draft.

97
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:37,960
So,

98
00:03:38,039 --> 00:03:39,319
someone gave my draft

99
00:03:39,479 --> 00:03:40,319
to Lingyu Group.

100
00:03:47,479 --> 00:03:48,560
From the company's system,

101
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:50,039
we recovered the device connection log.

102
00:03:50,639 --> 00:03:52,800
Last Friday at 11:47 PM,

103
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:54,080
an external device copied

104
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:57,000
project files from Lin Hua's computer.

105
00:03:57,800 --> 00:04:00,000
That flash drive had also been plugged

106
00:04:00,319 --> 00:04:02,240
into Mr. Zhao Song's office computer.

107
00:04:10,479 --> 00:04:11,479
That doesn't prove it was me.

108
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:13,280
I often leave my office unlocked.

109
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:15,080
Anyone could've gone in.

110
00:04:18,199 --> 00:04:19,000
What if we add

111
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,360
the evidence I have?

112
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:27,720
Enough for you now?

113
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:35,319
The plans Lingyu received

114
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,920
were sent
from Mr. Zhao's personal email.

115
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:39,439
And

116
00:04:40,319 --> 00:04:42,360
I found the security footage
you deleted.

117
00:04:45,839 --> 00:04:46,959
(It really was Mr. Zhao.)

118
00:04:51,839 --> 00:04:52,480
Mr. Zhao,

119
00:04:53,199 --> 00:04:56,279
you're not very good
at playing both sides.

120
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,360
Someone put me up to it.

121
00:05:02,879 --> 00:05:04,600
I just thought she was
too inexperienced.

122
00:05:05,079 --> 00:05:05,959
She'd only just joined.

123
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:07,480
Why give her such a huge project?

124
00:05:08,839 --> 00:05:09,839
Why?

125
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:12,480
Her talent and her work speak for her.

126
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:14,199
Your jealousy doesn't.

127
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:23,959
Mr. Zhao,

128
00:05:24,519 --> 00:05:26,279
you can question my ability

129
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,240
or experience.

130
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:28,639
But I won't accept

131
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:29,680
baseless attacks

132
00:05:29,839 --> 00:05:31,399
on a designer's reputation.

133
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:34,000
To me, a design

134
00:05:34,199 --> 00:05:35,399
is more than a drawing.

135
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:37,399
It's countless late nights

136
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,480
and endless rounds of starting over.

137
00:05:42,439 --> 00:05:42,959
Zhao Song,

138
00:05:43,879 --> 00:05:44,600
effective now,

139
00:05:44,959 --> 00:05:45,920
you're suspended.

140
00:05:46,439 --> 00:05:47,519
You'll never work here again.

141
00:05:49,199 --> 00:05:49,759
Security.

142
00:05:50,439 --> 00:05:51,040
Take him out.

143
00:05:52,279 --> 00:05:52,759
Ms. Xie,

144
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:54,360
I didn't mean it.

145
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:55,639
Please, give me another chance.

146
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:56,759
Just one more chance.

147
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:57,319
Ms. Xie!

148
00:05:58,800 --> 00:05:59,279
Ms. Xie!

149
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:00,120
This...

150
00:06:00,399 --> 00:06:01,639
- I didn't mean it!
- Move.

151
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:02,160
Ms. Xie!

152
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:03,439
Ms. Xie!

153
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:07,199
Lin Hua,

154
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:08,600
your proposal

155
00:06:09,519 --> 00:06:10,040
is approved.

156
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:12,480
(Congrats!)

157
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:13,000
(Congrats!)

158
00:06:13,079 --> 00:06:14,000
(Congratulations, Lin Hua!)

159
00:06:25,879 --> 00:06:26,600
Thank you, everyone.

160
00:06:28,079 --> 00:06:28,720
Thank you, Ms. Xie.

161
00:06:35,380 --> 00:06:39,820
♪I want to watch you every moment♪

162
00:06:41,066 --> 00:06:41,820
♪And you?♪

163
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:42,759
(Mr. Xie:)
(Mrs. Xie.)

164
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:43,879
(You're amazing.)

165
00:06:46,519 --> 00:06:48,959
Mrs. Xie.

166
00:06:48,959 --> 00:06:51,740
♪My heart my love♪

167
00:06:51,740 --> 00:06:55,230
♪I hope for a whole lifetime♪

168
00:06:55,230 --> 00:06:57,660
♪Holding you tight every moment♪

169
00:06:57,660 --> 00:07:02,980
♪Like an endless sea of stars♪

170
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:06,600
♪My heart my love♪

171
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:08,680
♪I hope♪

172
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:12,820
♪You feel my love♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

173
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:17,560
♪Only you in my eyes♪

174
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:21,880
♪Love you♪

175
00:07:41,140 --> 00:07:46,460
♪I want to watch you every moment♪

176
00:07:47,066 --> 00:07:48,540
♪And you?♪

177
00:07:48,540 --> 00:07:54,060
♪Is this a dream?♪

178
00:07:55,986 --> 00:08:01,980
♪The world stops. Only our hearts beat♪

179
